---
import type { Locale } from '../../i18n';
import { localePath } from '../../i18n';
interface Props { locale: Locale; active?: 'legacy' | 'ceiling' | 'openevo2' | 'index' }
const { locale, active = 'index' } = Astro.props;
const zh = locale === 'zh';
const t = (cn:string,en:string) => zh ? cn : en;
const p = (path:string) => localePath(locale,path);
---
<section class="s2-choice" data-testid="stage2-strategy-selector" aria-labelledby="s2-choice-title">
  <div class="s2-choice__head">
    <p>{t('从旧 Stage 2 到新版 OpenEvo 的三次设计转折', 'THREE DESIGN TURNS FROM OLD STAGE 2 TO THE OPENEVO REDESIGN')}</p>
    <h2 id="s2-choice-title">{t('先修“成功经验进不了训练”，再发现“行动接口本身也会影响我们看到的轨迹”', 'First fix successful experience being blocked from training; then confront how the action interface itself changes the trajectories we observe')}</h2>
    <span>{t('第一版把每 256 次任务单独设门槛，导致有成功经验也不更新；第二版 Ceiling-1.0 删掉这道门，7B 开始持续产生参数更新，而 3B 暴露出 bootstrap 与 action-validity 问题。后续 Harness 研究改变了 on-policy action contract，因此新版不再从旧 Stage 1 直接分叉，而是 fresh Stage 1 重开。', 'The first design judged every 256 attempts separately, so successful experience could still fail to reach training. Ceiling-1.0 removed that gate; 7B began sustaining parameter updates while 3B exposed bootstrap and action-validity problems. Later harness work changed the on-policy action contract, so the redesign no longer forks directly from the old Stage 1 and instead restarts with a fresh Stage 1.')}</span>
  </div>

  <div class="s2-choice__shared" aria-label={t('历史 Ceiling-1.0 与新版 OpenEvo 的数据边界不同','Historical Ceiling-1.0 and the OpenEvo redesign use different data boundaries')}>
    <div><span>{t('历史路线','HISTORICAL LINE')}</span><strong>{t('Ceiling-1.0 的 Stage 1 已完成','Ceiling-1.0 Stage 1 is complete')}</strong><small>{t('旧 trajectory / MiniMax / OPSD / carriers 原样保留为历史证据','Old trajectories / MiniMax / OPSD / carriers remain historical evidence')}</small></div>
    <svg viewBox="0 0 90 24" aria-hidden="true"><defs><marker id="s2-arrow" markerWidth="7" markerHeight="7" refX="6" refY="3.5" orient="auto"><path d="M0,0 L7,3.5 L0,7 Z" /></marker></defs><path d="M2 12 H84" /></svg>
    <div><span>{t('新的科学边界','FRESH SCIENTIFIC BOUNDARY')}</span><strong>{t('Harness201.1 后重新采 Stage 1','Recollect Stage 1 after Harness201.1')}</strong><small>{t('新 trajectory → 新 MiniMax → 新 downstream → 新 Stage 2 起点','fresh trajectories → fresh MiniMax → fresh downstream → fresh Stage-2 origin')}</small></div>
  </div>

  <div class="s2-choice__grid">
    <a class:list={['s2-choice__card','legacy',{active:active==='legacy'}]} href={p('/research/seed-openevo/study/capability-exploration/stage2-256-window/')} aria-current={active==='legacy'?'page':undefined}>
      <div><span>01 · {t('第一版 · 已取代','FIRST DESIGN · SUPERSEDED')}</span><b>{t('有成功经验，但每 256 次重新过门槛，最后一次参数更新都没发生', 'Successful experience existed, but every 256 attempts re-applied a gate and no parameter update happened')}</b></div>
      <p>{t('每 256 次任务是一批；同一批必须有 8 个不同任务各自成功 2 次才允许更新。不同批之间不能累计成功，所以 7B/self 即使最终有 797 条可训练成功轨迹，Stage 2 仍是 0 次参数更新。', 'Every 256 attempts formed one batch, and at least eight distinct tasks each had to succeed twice before parameters could update. Success could not carry across batches, so even 797 trainable exact-success traces in 7B/self still resulted in zero Stage-2 updates.')}</p>
      <strong>{t('查看第一版为什么设计错 →','Open why the first design failed →')}</strong>
    </a>
    <a class:list={['s2-choice__card','ceiling',{active:active==='ceiling'}]} href={p('/research/seed-openevo/study/capability-exploration/stage2-ceiling/')} aria-current={active==='ceiling'?'page':undefined}>
      <div><span>02 · {t('第二版 · 7B 点燃，3B 暴露新问题','SECOND DESIGN · 7B IGNITES, 3B EXPOSES A NEW PROBLEM')}</span><b>OpenEVO-Ceiling-1.0</b></div>
      <p>{t('旧门槛删掉后，每 128 次任务形成一轮证据。历史诊断快照记录：7B 继续产生参数更新，3B 完成 18 轮时仍是 0 个新参数组件，并频繁选择当前页面不存在的动作。18 轮是历史快照，不是现在的 live 3B 状态。', 'After removing the old gate, every 128 attempts form one evidence round. The historical diagnostic snapshot recorded continued 7B parameter updates and zero new 3B parameter components after 18 completed rounds, with frequent actions unavailable on the current page. The 18-round figure is historical, not the current live 3B state.')}</p>
      <strong>{t('查看 3B 为什么没有触发参数学习 →','Open why 3B did not ignite parameter learning →')}</strong>
    </a>
    <a class:list={['s2-choice__card','openevo2',{active:active==='openevo2'}]} href={p('/research/seed-openevo/study/capability-exploration/openevo-2-0/')} aria-current={active==='openevo2'?'page':undefined}>
      <div><span>03 · {t('第三次转折 · 从 Stage 1 重开','THIRD TURN · RESTART FROM STAGE 1')}</span><b>{t('重新设计 OpenEvo','Redesigning OpenEvo')}</b></div>
      <p>{t('新的 Harness 把 reasoning 与 action validity 分开，并对真正的 WebShop action 做动态硬约束。因为这会改变模型实际产生的 trajectory，旧 Stage 1 不再作为正式 successor 数据；新版从 fresh Stage 1、fresh MiniMax 和 fresh downstream 重新建立 Stage 2 起点。', 'The new harness separates reasoning from action validity and hard-constrains actual WebShop actions against the live dynamic action set. Because this changes the trajectories the model produces, the old Stage 1 is no longer official successor data; the redesign rebuilds its Stage-2 origin from fresh Stage 1, fresh MiniMax, and fresh downstream state.')}</p>
      <strong>{t('进入重新设计 OpenEvo →','Open the OpenEvo redesign →')}</strong>
    </a>
  </div>
</section>
<style>
.s2-choice{margin:1rem 0 1.4rem;padding:1rem;border:1px solid var(--color-border);border-radius:18px;background:color-mix(in srgb,var(--color-text) 1.5%,transparent)}
.s2-choice__head{display:grid;grid-template-columns:minmax(180px,.45fr) minmax(0,1fr);gap:.65rem 1.2rem;padding:.15rem .15rem 1rem;border-bottom:1px solid var(--color-border)}.s2-choice__head>p{grid-column:1/-1;margin:0;color:var(--color-accent);font:800 .62rem/1.3 ui-monospace,SFMono-Regular,Menlo,monospace;letter-spacing:.1em}.s2-choice__head h2{margin:0;font-size:clamp(1.15rem,2.6vw,1.7rem);letter-spacing:-.035em}.s2-choice__head>span{color:var(--color-text-muted);font-size:.78rem;line-height:1.65}
.s2-choice__shared{display:grid;grid-template-columns:minmax(0,1fr) 90px minmax(0,1fr);gap:.65rem;align-items:center;margin-top:1rem;padding:.8rem;border:1px solid var(--color-border);border-radius:11px;background:color-mix(in srgb,var(--color-accent) 3%,var(--color-bg))}.s2-choice__shared>div{min-width:0}.s2-choice__shared span,.s2-choice__shared strong,.s2-choice__shared small{display:block}.s2-choice__shared span{color:var(--color-accent);font:800 .54rem ui-monospace,SFMono-Regular,Menlo,monospace;letter-spacing:.07em}.s2-choice__shared strong{margin:.24rem 0;font-size:.78rem}.s2-choice__shared small{color:var(--color-text-muted);font-size:.64rem}.s2-choice__shared svg{width:100%;height:24px}.s2-choice__shared svg path{fill:none;stroke:var(--color-accent);stroke-width:1.7;marker-end:url(#s2-arrow)}.s2-choice__shared svg marker path{fill:var(--color-accent);stroke:none}
.s2-choice__grid{display:grid;grid-template-columns:repeat(3,minmax(0,1fr));gap:.8rem;margin-top:1rem}.s2-choice__card{display:flex;min-width:0;flex-direction:column;gap:.7rem;padding:1rem;border:1px solid var(--color-border);border-radius:13px;color:var(--color-text);text-decoration:none;background:var(--color-bg);transition:border-color .15s ease,background-color .15s ease}.s2-choice__card:hover,.s2-choice__card.active{border-color:var(--color-accent)}.s2-choice__card div{display:flex;flex-direction:column;gap:.25rem}.s2-choice__card span{font:800 .58rem ui-monospace,SFMono-Regular,Menlo,monospace;letter-spacing:.07em;color:var(--color-text-muted)}.s2-choice__card b{font-size:1rem}.s2-choice__card p{margin:0;color:var(--color-text-muted);font-size:.75rem;line-height:1.62}.s2-choice__card>strong{margin-top:auto;color:var(--color-accent);font-size:.71rem}.s2-choice__card.legacy{border-style:dashed}.s2-choice__card.legacy.active{background:color-mix(in srgb,var(--color-warning) 5%,var(--color-bg))}.s2-choice__card.ceiling.active{background:color-mix(in srgb,var(--color-accent) 5%,var(--color-bg))}.s2-choice__card.openevo2{border-width:2px}.s2-choice__card.openevo2.active{background:color-mix(in srgb,var(--color-accent) 7%,var(--color-bg))}
@media(max-width:900px){.s2-choice__grid{grid-template-columns:1fr 1fr}.s2-choice__card.openevo2{grid-column:1/-1}}
@media(max-width:760px){.s2-choice__head,.s2-choice__grid,.s2-choice__shared{grid-template-columns:1fr}.s2-choice__head>p{grid-column:auto}.s2-choice__shared svg{width:30px;transform:rotate(90deg);justify-self:center}.s2-choice__card.openevo2{grid-column:auto}}
</style>
